1
00:00:00,182 --> 00:00:01,780
Her sister called her a jinx.

2
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:02,380
The crime lord

3
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:04,198
who raised her called her perfect.

4
00:00:04,198 --> 00:00:06,410
Piltover is a shining city of inventors.

5
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:07,680
Beneath it lies Zaun,

6
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:10,123
the undercity: poor, poisoned and lawless.

7
00:00:10,123 --> 00:00:11,220
Down there, glowing crystals

8
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:13,120
called hextech can power anything,

9
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:14,007
or blow it apart.

10
00:00:14,007 --> 00:00:15,260
Powder and her big sister, Vi,

11
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:18,182
were orphans, raised by Vander, a retired fighter.

12
00:00:18,182 --> 00:00:20,000
Her brother Mylo called her a jinx:

13
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,910
someone who ruins everything she touches.

14
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:23,540
Only Vi believed in her.

15
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:25,650
Powder built little bombs shaped like monkeys.

16
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,383
None of them ever worked.

17
00:00:27,383 --> 00:00:29,830
Then a crime boss, Silco, captured Vander.

18
00:00:30,040 --> 00:00:31,080
The kids went to save him,

19
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:32,440
and left Powder behind.

20
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:33,780
She followed them with a monkey bomb,

21
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:35,330
packed with hextech crystals.

22
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:36,709
This time, it worked.

23
00:00:37,045 --> 00:00:38,710
The blast killed two of her brothers.

24
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,064
Vander was lost.

25
00:00:40,350 --> 00:00:41,180
And Vi said it.

26
00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:41,960
Mylo was right.

27
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:42,740
You're a jinx.

28
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:43,791
Then Vi was gone.

29
00:00:44,124 --> 00:00:45,220
Alone in the smoke,

30
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,480
she ran into the arms of the man

31
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:47,700
who started it all.

32
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:48,869
Silco took her in.

33
00:00:48,869 --> 00:00:50,190
He raised her as his daughter.

34
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:53,350
Powder became Jinx: brilliant, broken, and dangerous.

35
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:55,720
Years later, in a breakdown, she shot him.

36
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:56,700
Then she fired a rocket

37
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:58,189
at the council of Piltover.

38
00:00:58,455 --> 00:00:59,800
That explains her pain.

39
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:01,343
It doesn't excuse what she did.

40
00:01:01,655 --> 00:01:02,720
With his last breath,

41
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:03,500
Silco said he never

42
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:04,700
would have given her up.

43
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:05,300
Don't cry.

44
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:06,053
You're perfect.

45
00:01:06,613 --> 00:01:08,100
Her sister called her a jinx.

46
00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:10,029
A monster called her perfect.
